// Remote Thread Created by a Program in a User Folder
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_remote_thread_from_user_folder.yml (3bea6379-2f9a-4ce2-b888-b89f945b3be5)
// Level: high. ATT&CK: T1055 Process Injection
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"8") and (process.executable like~ ("*\\Temp\\*", "*\\AppData\\*", "*\\Users\\Public\\*", "*\\ProgramData\\*", "*\\Downloads\\*"))
